{"variant": "minutes", "year": 2013, "month": 5, "day": 9, "slug": "vendor-contract-renewal-3345", "variant_int": 3, "html": "<section class=\"page-banner\"><div class=\"container\"><p class=\"text-uppercase mb-1\" style=\"color:var(--gold);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.18em;font-size:.75rem\"><a href=\"/archive/\" style=\"color:var(--gold)\">Archive</a> &rsaquo; <a href=\"/archive/2013/\" style=\"color:var(--gold)\">2013</a> &rsaquo; <a href=\"/archive/2013/05/\" style=\"color:var(--gold)\">05</a> &rsaquo; 09</p><p style=\"color:rgba(255,255,255,.6);font-size:.72rem;margin-bottom:.4rem;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase\">Meeting Minutes &bull; MIN-2013-05-4147</p><h1 style=\"font-size:clamp(1.2rem,3vw,2rem);line-height:1.25\">Equity Awards Committee — Vendor Contract Renewal</h1><p style=\"color:rgba(255,255,255,.7);font-size:.9rem;margin-bottom:0\">2013-05-09 &bull; Virtual Meeting (Google Meet)</p></div></section><section style=\"padding:3rem 0;background:var(--surface)\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"row g-4\"><div class=\"col-lg-8\"><div style=\"background:white;border:1px solid var(--border);border-left:4px solid var(--gold);padding:1.25rem 1.5rem;margin-bottom:2rem\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:.5rem\">Meeting Information</div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:.3rem .8rem;font-size:.83rem;margin-bottom:.75rem\"><div><span style=\"font-size:.68rem;opacity:.55;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em\">Committee</span><br><strong>Equity Awards Committee</strong></div><div><span style=\"font-size:.68rem;opacity:.55;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em\">Date</span><br><strong>2013-05-09</strong></div><div><span style=\"font-size:.68rem;opacity:.55;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em\">Location</span><br>Virtual Meeting (Google Meet)</div><div><span style=\"font-size:.68rem;opacity:.55;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em\">Meeting Ref</span><br><code style=\"font-size:.75rem\">MIN-2013-05-4147</code></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;padding-top:.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border)\"><span style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;padding:.2rem .5rem;background:#dcfce7;color:#15803d;border:1px solid #86efac\">&#10003; QUORUM ESTABLISHED</span><span style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666\">4 of 6 members present</span></div></div><div class=\"mb-4\"><h5 style=\"font-weight:800;color:var(--navy);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;font-size:.8rem;margin-bottom:1rem;padding-bottom:.5rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--gold)\">Attendance</h5><table class=\"dash-table w-100\"><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Title</th><th>Role</th><th style=\"text-align:center\">Present</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"font-weight:600\">Gizem Tripathi</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Communications Coordinator</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">Associate Vice President</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#15803d;font-weight:700\">&#10003;</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-weight:600\">Vani Desta</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Vice President of Research</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">Program Manager</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#15803d;font-weight:700\">&#10003;</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-weight:600\">Concepcion Malone</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Manager of Regulatory Compliance</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">Sales Consultant (External)</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#15803d;font-weight:700\">&#10003;</span></td></tr><tr style=\"opacity:.5\"><td style=\"font-weight:400\">Tolga Tanaka</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Chief Communications Officer</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">Consultant (External)</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#ccc\">&mdash;</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-weight:600\">Adaeze Callahan</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Associate, Policy &amp; Government Relations</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">Facilitator</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#15803d;font-weight:700\">&#10003;</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"mb-4\"><h5 style=\"font-weight:800;color:var(--navy);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;font-size:.8rem;margin-bottom:1rem;padding-bottom:.5rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--gold)\">Agenda</h5><div style=\"margin-bottom:1.5rem;padding-bottom:1.25rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#999;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Item 1</div><h6 style=\"font-size:.92rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.6rem\">Stock Ownership Guideline Compliance Review</h6><p style=\"font-size:.87rem;line-height:1.7;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">Vani Desta walked the committee through the Stock Ownership Guideline Compliance Review proposal. The proposal aims to address long-standing issues affecting 43 employees in the 12 region. After a thorough debate on the budgetary impact and timeline, the committee moved to a formal resolution. All related materials were previously distributed as Exhibit A.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:1.5rem;padding-bottom:1.25rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#999;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Item 2</div><h6 style=\"font-size:.92rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.6rem\">Special Litigation Matter Update</h6><p style=\"font-size:.87rem;line-height:1.7;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">The Special Litigation Matter Update was a review of the company&#x27;s compliance with contract laws. The committee reviewed the company&#x27;s contracting process and confirmed that it was in compliance.</p><div style=\"background:#f8f9fb;border:1px solid var(--border);border-left:3px solid var(--navy);padding:.8rem 1rem;margin-top:.65rem\"><div style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.4rem\">Motion</div><p style=\"margin-bottom:.4rem;font-size:.83rem;line-height:1.6;color:#333\"><strong>To note for the record:</strong> RESOLVED, that the Equity Awards Committee approves the public disclosure of the Special Litigation Matter Update in the company&#x27;s upcoming proxy statement.</p><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555;margin-bottom:.3rem\"><strong>Moved:</strong> Vani Desta &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; <strong>Seconded:</strong> Adaeze Callahan</div><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555\"><strong>Vote:</strong> 3 Yea &nbsp;/&nbsp; 1 Nay &nbsp;/&nbsp; 0 Abstain &nbsp;&mdash;&nbsp; <strong style=\"color:#15803d\">CARRIED</strong></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:1.5rem;padding-bottom:1.25rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#999;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Item 3</div><h6 style=\"font-size:.92rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.6rem\">Shareholder Engagement Strategy — Proxy Season 2013</h6><p style=\"font-size:.87rem;line-height:1.7;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">The committee reviewed the Shareholder Engagement Strategy — Proxy Season 2013, a proposal to enter the 12 market. The discussion focused on the competitive landscape and the regulatory hurdles. The committee approved a budget for a feasibility study.</p><div style=\"background:#f8f9fb;border:1px solid var(--border);border-left:3px solid var(--navy);padding:.8rem 1rem;margin-top:.65rem\"><div style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.4rem\">Motion</div><p style=\"margin-bottom:.4rem;font-size:.83rem;line-height:1.6;color:#333\"><strong>To approve for mitigation:</strong> RESOLVED, that the Equity Awards Committee approves the recommended approach to Shareholder Engagement Strategy — Proxy Season 2013 as described in Exhibit C, subject to legal review to be completed within 15 days of this meeting.</p><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555;margin-bottom:.3rem\"><strong>Moved:</strong> Adaeze Callahan &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; <strong>Seconded:</strong> Gizem Tripathi</div><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555\"><strong>Vote:</strong> 3 Yea &nbsp;/&nbsp; 1 Nay &nbsp;/&nbsp; 0 Abstain &nbsp;&mdash;&nbsp; <strong style=\"color:#15803d\">CARRIED</strong></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:1.5rem;padding-bottom:1.25rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#999;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Item 4</div><h6 style=\"font-size:.92rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.6rem\">Internal Investigation Update — Matter 43</h6><p style=\"font-size:.87rem;line-height:1.7;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">The meeting began with a review of the minutes from the prior session, which were approved without modification. The committee then turned to the main agenda item, Internal Investigation Update — Matter 43. Gizem Tripathi provided a 15-minute summary, followed by a Q&amp;A session.</p><div style=\"background:#f8f9fb;border:1px solid var(--border);border-left:3px solid var(--navy);padding:.8rem 1rem;margin-top:.65rem\"><div style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.4rem\">Motion</div><p style=\"margin-bottom:.4rem;font-size:.83rem;line-height:1.6;color:#333\"><strong>To approve for target:</strong> RESOLVED, that the Equity Awards Committee approves the minutes of the meeting held on 2013-05-09 as drafted and circulated.</p><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555;margin-bottom:.3rem\"><strong>Moved:</strong> Adaeze Callahan &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; <strong>Seconded:</strong> Concepcion Malone</div><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555\"><strong>Vote:</strong> 3 Yea &nbsp;/&nbsp; 0 Nay &nbsp;/&nbsp; 1 Abstain &nbsp;&mdash;&nbsp; <strong style=\"color:#15803d\">CARRIED</strong></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mb-4\"><h5 style=\"font-weight:800;color:var(--navy);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;font-size:.8rem;margin-bottom:1rem;padding-bottom:.5rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--gold)\">Action Items</h5><table class=\"dash-table w-100\"><thead><tr><th style=\"width:2rem\">#</th><th>Description</th><th>Owner</th><th>Due</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"color:#999;font-weight:600\">1</td><td style=\"font-size:.83rem\">Conduct due diligence on the potential acquisition target, Hanover Consulting</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap\">Catherine Okoro</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666;white-space:nowrap\">2013-06-28</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#999;font-weight:600\">2</td><td style=\"font-size:.83rem\">Conduct a review of the company&#x27;s data classification and handling policy</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap\">Mohan Suthirat</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666;white-space:nowrap\">2013-06-28</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#999;font-weight:600\">3</td><td style=\"font-size:.83rem\">Analyze the cost-effectiveness of the current talent acquisition channels</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap\">Leonora Dahl</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666;white-space:nowrap\">2013-07-28</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#999;font-weight:600\">4</td><td style=\"font-size:.83rem\">Prepare a presentation on the company&#x27;s cybersecurity posture</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap\">Cyrus Owens</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666;white-space:nowrap\">2013-07-28</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#999;font-weight:600\">5</td><td style=\"font-size:.83rem\">Develop a set of KPIs for the new Internal Investigation Update — Matter 43 initiative</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap\">Riley Manalo</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666;white-space:nowrap\">2013-07-28</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div style=\"border:1px solid var(--border);padding:1rem 1.2rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem\"><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;color:#333;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:.5rem\">There being no further business, a motion to adjourn was made and carried unanimously. Meeting adjourned at 4:45 PM CT.</p><p style=\"font-size:.83rem;margin-bottom:.75rem;color:#555\"><strong>Next meeting:</strong> 2013-06-13</p><div><p style=\"font-size:.78rem;color:#888;margin-bottom:.25rem\">Respectfully submitted,</p><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.1rem\">Adaeze Callahan</p><p style=\"font-size:.78rem;color:#666;margin-bottom:.75rem\">Associate, Policy &amp; Government Relations, Facilitator</p><div style=\"display:flex;gap:2rem\"><div><div style=\"width:160px;border-bottom:1px solid #aaa;margin-bottom:.2rem;height:1.5rem\"></div><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;color:#888\">Signature</div></div><div><div style=\"width:120px;border-bottom:1px solid #aaa;margin-bottom:.2rem;height:1.5rem\"></div><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;color:#888\">Approved: ___________</div></div></div></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding-top:1rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border)\"><a href=\"/archive/2013/05/08/executive-session-protocol-review-5945/\" style=\"font-size:.85rem;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none\">&larr; Previous</a><a href=\"/archive/2013/05/09/vendor-contract-renewal-3345/section-280g-calculations-6174/\" style=\"font-size:.85rem;color:var(--navy);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none\">Next &rarr;</a></div></div><div class=\"col-lg-4 d-none d-lg-block\"><div style=\"position:sticky;top:2rem\"><div class=\"acpwb-card mb-3\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:800;text-transform:u